#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:3 16abf4de39e44dd1a07b7239ab8dfe41
msgid "**ARCHIVED SETUP INSTRUCTIONS PRIOR TO COPTER 3.6 VERSIONS**"
msgstr "**COPTER 3.6版本之前的存档设置说明**"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:6 3f8645c2b330480091900ce20a03631a
msgid "Copter 3.4.x"
msgstr "Copter 3.4.x"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:8 09c6d80312764972ae734e637771d2b4
msgid ""
":ref:`MOT_YAW_SV_ANGLE <MOT_YAW_SV_ANGLE>`: tail servo's maximum lean angle "
"in degrees.  This allows for the rear motor's thrust to be adjusted "
"appropriately depending upon the lean angle.  The default is 30 degrees.  "
"\"0\" would mean the tail servo can only point directly up (which would not "
"allow the vehicle to fly), \"90\" means the tail servo can point "
"horizontally."
msgstr ""
":ref:`MOT_YAW_SV_ANGLE "
"<MOT_YAW_SV_ANGLE>`：尾舵机的最大倾斜角度（度）。这允许根据倾斜角度适当调整尾部电机的推力。默认值为30度。\"0\"表示尾舵机只能直接向上指（这样飞行器无法飞行），\"90\"表示尾舵机可以水平指向。"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:10
#: b1a659f0e12643828a70754e903d9cec
msgid ""
"The channel used for the tail servo can be changed from its default (channel"
" 7) by setting the appropriate SERVOx_FUNCTION to 39.  For example the "
":ref:`Pixracer <common-pixracer-overview>` only has 6 output channels so the"
" tail servo can be moved to output channel 5 by setting "
":ref:`SERVO5_FUNCTION <SERVO5_FUNCTION>` to 39."
msgstr ""
"用于尾舵机的通道可以通过将相应的SERVOx_FUNCTION设置为39来从默认值（通道7）更改。例如 :ref:`Pixracer <common-"
"pixracer-overview>` 只有6个输出通道，因此可以通过将 :ref:`SERVO5_FUNCTION "
"<SERVO5_FUNCTION>` 设置为39将尾舵机移至输出通道5。"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:12
#: 89fcfd9719274b9bbdb8f21c93c0cf79
msgid "See Copter 3.3 section below for more parameters that can be adjusted."
msgstr "有关可调整的更多参数，请参见下面的Copter 3.3节。"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:15
#: d6ea538714784e599b9202d26eb1557b
msgid "Copter 3.3.x"
msgstr "Copter 3.3.x"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:17
#: b9786ac4a93146cf95e1ad9e6e4e30ca
msgid ""
"``MOT_YAW_SV_MIN <MOT_YAW_SV_MIN>``: tail servo's lowest PWM value before "
"binding occurs."
msgstr "``MOT_YAW_SV_MIN <MOT_YAW_SV_MIN>``：尾舵机发生卡死前的最低PWM值。"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:18
#: 55405070e47a49a7bf0b622911c41b94
msgid ""
"``MOT_YAW_SV_MAX <MOT_YAW_SV_MAX>``: tail servo's highest PWM value before "
"binding occurs."
msgstr "``MOT_YAW_SV_MAX <MOT_YAW_SV_MAX>``：尾舵机发生卡死前的最高PWM值。"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:19
#: b33434cbea6f4647836f8e97838ee202
msgid ""
"``MOT_YAW_SV_TRIM <MOT_YAW_SV_TRIM>``: tail servo's PWM value close to what "
"is required to keep the tail from spinning."
msgstr "``MOT_YAW_SV_TRIM <MOT_YAW_SV_TRIM>``：接近防止尾部旋转所需的尾舵机PWM值。"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:20
#: 74eacad1a2d5475c8e8ad7ae6e4c564c
msgid ""
"``MOT_YAW_SV_REV <MOT_YAW_SV_REV>``: tail servo's reverse setting.  +1 = "
"servo moves in default direction, -1 to reverse direction of movement."
msgstr ""
"``MOT_YAW_SV_REV <MOT_YAW_SV_REV>``：尾舵机反向设置。+1 = 舵机按默认方向运动，-1 = 运动方向反转。"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:23
#: ddd53a08356a411f8161ce80b3959c82
msgid "Copter 3.2.1 (and earlier)"
msgstr "Copter 3.2.1（及更早版本）"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:25
#: 0bfb300fcc4a47b78ffd889eb9779abe
msgid ""
":ref:`RC7_MIN <RC7_MIN>`: tail servo's lowest PWM value before binding "
"occurs."
msgstr ":ref:`RC7_MIN <RC7_MIN>`：尾舵机发生卡死前的最低PWM值。"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:26
#: 75b80ac95f6c401cbfb761065158c2c2
msgid ""
":ref:`RC7_MAX <RC7_MAX>`: tail servo's highest PWM value before binding "
"occurs."
msgstr ":ref:`RC7_MAX <RC7_MAX>`：尾舵机发生卡死前的最高PWM值。"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:27
#: d158076e30ee4c8a9bc3e716912db4e7
msgid ""
":ref:`RC7_MIN <RC7_TRIM>`: tail servo's PWM value close to what is required "
"to keep the tail from spinning."
msgstr ":ref:`RC7_MIN <RC7_TRIM>`：接近防止尾部旋转所需的尾舵机PWM值。"

#: ../../source/docs/archived-tricopter.rst:28
#: 92302e2d75174bf9ba51e5a792dcd7e0
msgid ""
":ref:`RC7_REVERSED <RC7_REVERSED>`: tail servo's reverse setting.  +1 = "
"servo moves in default direction, -1 to reverse direction of movement."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RC7_REVERSED <RC7_REVERSED>`：尾舵机反向设置。+1 = 舵机按默认方向运动，-1 = 运动方向反转。"
